    <stringTable>
      <string id="AboutDialog_Explain">Enable this option to set the new contents in 'About Foxit PhantomPDF' dialog.

Copyright: Change the content of copyright. The default is Foxit information.

Copyright Content: Change the contents under copyright information. The default lists the technology built in Foxit PhantomPDF.

BackGroundPath: Set the path of the logo.</string>
      <string id="Advertise_Explain">Enable this option to change the settings of advertisement in right corner of the tab bar.

Check 'Remove Advertisement' to hide advertisements in the right corner of the tab bar and disable the setting in 'Preferences > General > Application Startup'.

Check 'Scroll'  to scroll the ads circularly and set the Rolling Time. The default time is 10 seconds.

Folder Path: Change the folder path of advertisements in order to change the advertisements. There should be a 'Profile.xml' file in the new advertisement folder. This file defines the ad image, message and link address. Please refer to the xml file in the Foxit PhantomPDF application folder ('..\Foxit PhantomPDF\Advertisement\Profile.xml') to get the format of  'Profile.xml' file.</string>
