      <string id="ROTATEVIEW">Rotate View</string>
      <string id="SafeReadingMode_Explain">Enable this option to check the option of 'Preferences > Trust Manager > Enable safe Reading Mode'

Check this option for controlling unauthorized action and date transmissions; including URL connection, launching external files and running JavaScript functions to efficiently avoid attacks from malicious documents. 

If you disable this option, you can open any files.</string>
