	 <string id="PREF_ShowBulbAffects">Show the message which affects the next step</string>
	 <string id="PREF_ShowBulbNotification">Show the notification related message</string>
	 <string id="PREF_ShowBulbPDFA">Show PDF/A message again</string>
	 <string id="PREF_NotificationMsg">Notification Messages</string>	  
	 <string id="PREF_NotificationMsg_Explain">Enable the option and choose how to deal with the different notification messages. If you uncheck all the options, the notification messages will never be shown.

This will change the corresponding setting in Preferences > General.</string>
	  <string id="PREF_RequirePasswordSignatures">Require password to use signatures</string>
	  <string id="PREF_RequirePasswordSignatures_Explain">Choose 'Enabled' to require to create and use new signatures with passwords.
  
Choose 'Disabled' to not require to create or use new signatures with passwords.

This will change the setting of 'Require password to use this signature' in PDF Sign > Create Signature > Options.</string>

	 <string id="PREF_ProtectedView">Protected View</string>	  
	 <string id="PREF_ProtectedView_Explain">Choose 'Enabled' and select 'Files from potentially unsafe locations' or 'All Files' to turn on protected view in order to protect your computers from being harmed by files originated from potentially unsafe locations.

Choose 'Enabled' and select 'Off' to turn off protected view.

This will change the setting in Preferences > Security > Protected View.</string>
	 <string id="PREF_ProtectedViewUnsafe">Files from potentially unsafe locations</string>
	 <string id="PREF_ProtectedViewAllFiles">All Files</string>
	 <string id="PREF_ProtectedViewOff">Off</string>
	 <string id="PREF_ProtectedViewOpt">Settings:</string>
     <string id="PREF_MultipleInstances">Multiple Instances</string>
	 <string id="PREF_MultipleInstances_Explain">Enable this option to allow multiple instances. 
Disable this option to not allow multiple instances. 
This will change the corresponding setting in Preferences > Documents. </string>
     <string id="PREF_FixNetDocumentItem">Add NetDocuments to the open List</string>
	 <string id="PREF_FixNetDocumentItem_Explain">Enable this option to add NetDocuments to the File > Open List. Users cannot remove this option from their end. </string>
     <string id="PREF_PrintGDIOutput">Use GDI+ Output for all types of printer</string>
     <string id="PREF_PrintGDIOutput_Explain">Check 'Use GDI+ Output for all types of printer' to use GDI+ Output for PS driver printer, PCL drvier printer will not change.

This will change the setting in Preferences > Print > Use GDI+ Output for all types of printer.</string>
	 <string id="PREF_DPISetting">Change high DPI settings</string>	  
	 <string id="PREF_DPISetting_Explain">Choose 'Application' to render correctly whenever the DPI of the display that they are running on changes.
	 
Choose 'System' to automatically being DPI scaled by Windows.
	 
Choose 'System(Enhanced)' to render correctly at a single display scale factor and become blurry whenever the DPI changes.</string>
	 <string id="PREF_DPISettingSystem">System</string>
	 <string id="PREF_DPISettingSysEnhanced">System(Enhanced)</string>
	 <string id="PREF_DPISettingApp">Application</string>
	 <string id="PREF_DPISettingOpt">Settings:</string>	  
	<string id="CPDF_InternalUpdateServer">Update Server</string>
 	<string id="CPDF_InternalUpdateServer_Explain">Set the path of Update Server.</string>
    <string id="CPDF_InternalUpdateServer_URL">Server URL:</string>
    <string id="PREF_TellMeWhat">Show TELL ME WHAT YOU WANT TO DO</string>
    <string id="PREF_TellMeWhat_Explain">Enable this option to show TELL ME WHAT YOU WANT TO DO.

Disable this option to not show TELL ME WHAT YOU WANT TO DO.</string>
    <string id="PREF_HideLiveChat">Disable Live Chat in the application</string>
    <string id="PREF_HideLiveChat_Explain">Enable this option to Hide Live Chat in the application.

Disable this option to show Live Chat in the application.</string>
   <string id="PREF_DisablePDFviewerSwitching_Explain">Enable this option to disable the ability to change the specified default handler (PDF viewer).</string>
   <string id="PREF_DisablePDFviewerSwitching">Disable default PDF viewer switching</string>
   <string id="PREF_LockAutoCompleteInForm_Explain">Enable this option to lock the Auto-Complete feature and disable the corresponding setting in Preferences > Forms.</string>
   <string id="PREF_LockAutoCompleteInForm">Locks the Auto-Complete in Form Filling</string>
   <string id="PREF_DisablePrivilegedLocations_Explain">Enable this option to disable and lock the end user's ability to add files, folders, and hosts as a privileged location prevents them from assigning trust and thereby exempting that location from enhanced security restrictions.</string>
   <string id="PREF_DisablePrivilegedLocations">Disable Privileged Locations</string>
   <string id="PREF_StartpageSet">Change the Support Tools in Start Page</string>
   <string id="PREF_StartpageSet_Explain">Enable this option to Change the Support Tools in Start Page.

Phone: Change the Support phone in the lower-left corner of Start Page.

Online trouble ticket URL: Change the online trouble ticket URL in the lower-left corner of Start Page.</string>
